Enter a fluid, mobile shooting stance that excels at close combat. Your ranged attack speed is increased by [12%, 19%, 23%, 26%, 28% (TL1-5)] and each time you shoot you gain [25%, 33%, 39%, 45%, 50% (TL1-5)] increased movement speed for 2 turns.

Ranged attacks against targets will also grant you up to [4%, 6%, 8%, 9%, 10% (TL1-5)] of a turn. This is 100% effective against targets within 3 tiles, and decreases by 20% for each tile beyond that (to 0% at 8 tiles). This cannot occur more than once per turn.

Requires a sling to use.
